            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "川普突然向沃什發難 威脅聯儲會不降息就切斷和對美順差國的貿易",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 美國總統唐納德·川普加大了對聯儲會降息的施壓，他甚至威脅說若央行按兵不動自己就要切斷和逆差對象國的貿易。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">強於預期的8月非農就業報告出爐後，川普周五在社交媒體上發表長篇大論提出降息要求，儘管新的數據可能是增強了聯儲會在9月15日舉行的下次會議上加息的理由。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">[川普說]聯儲會降息 不然就要切斷與對美順差國的貿易</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">川普在帖子中用「很棒」來形容他一手提拔的聯儲會主席凱文·沃什，還要求理事會「學聰明起來」，變成愛國者」。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-a64130d0-8d1d-33ec-a547-20fd3b0eaefd-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">「下調利率，否則我就停止與那些我們有逆差的國家貿易，」 川普寫道，「高利率讓美國陷於非常不公平的劣勢地位，而我絕不會允許那種事情發生！」</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">川普還聲稱，就連推翻了其關稅的美國最高法院也認可他有權這樣做。不過他若真實施貿易禁運，幾乎肯定會招致法律挑戰。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">切斷貿易會如何幫助降低美國借貸成本，這一點不得而知。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">川普發出的信號表明，雖然沃什剛接手數月，他已經失去了對聯儲會的耐心。前主席傑羅姆·鮑威爾就經常因為央行的政策決定受到川普抨擊。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國8月非農表現尤為亮眼 失業率持穩且前值大幅上修</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">沃什就任聯儲會主席後，川普曾一度收斂對聯儲會的施壓，但這次表態實際上意味著他已故態復萌。民調顯示美國民眾對川普應對生活成本上漲和伊朗戰爭的方式不滿，他的支持率在11月中期選舉前大幅下滑。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Trump Demands Fed Lower Rates, Reviving Pressure Campaign</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%B7%9D%E6%99%AE%E7%AA%81%E7%84%B6%E5%90%91%E6%B2%83%E4%BB%80%E7%99%BC%E9%9B%A3-%E5%A8%81%E8%84%85%E8%81%AF%E5%84%B2%E6%9C%83%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%8D%E6%81%AF%E5%B0%B1%E5%88%87%E6%96%B7%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%8D%E7%BE%8E%E9%A0%86%E5%B7%AE%E5%9C%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%B2%BF%E6%98%93-155451165.html",
